      {
        "t": "li",
        "x": "Products, colours and number of coats"
      },
      {
        "t": "li",
        "x": "Preparation: washing, scraping, sanding, caulking and priming"
      },
      {
        "t": "li",
        "x": "Repairs found during the work, and how they are priced"
      },
      {
        "t": "li",
        "x": "Protection of plants, windows and walkways, and the clean-up"
      },
      {
        "t": "p",
        "x": "**Next step:** see what our [exterior painting](/services/exterior-painting) work includes, then [book a free on-site visit](/book-online) and we will look at the siding, trim and soffits with you and send a free written quote that spells out the preparation and any repairs."
      },
      {
        "t": "p",
        "x": "For kitchens, bathrooms and basements, try the [instant estimate](/instant-quote); for exterior painting and everything else, start with the free on-site visit above, or call [431-866-5644](tel:+14318665644), Monday to Friday, 8:30 to 4:30."
      }
